  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Thomas J. Scanlon received a Bachelor of Arts, Business Administration from John Carroll University in 1959. He then graduated from Cleveland State University – Cleveland Marshall College of Law – J.D., cum laude in 1963 and was a Member Board of Editors – Cleveland Marshall Law Review. He has engaged in the private practice of law in Northeastern Ohio since 1963. The primary focus of practice is providing legal services in connection with the development, ownership, operation and management of industrial, commercial and residential properties and the..."
    ]
